# Keep Codex focused on the mobile app by default.
# The main working surface is:
# - DishGuru/app
# - DishGuru/components
# - DishGuru/lib
# - DishGuru/assets
# - supabase/functions (when backend/app integration is needed)

# Package/build noise
node_modules/
.expo/
.pnpm-store/
*.log
*.aab
*.apk
